#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Stiki, podjetja in vaši lastni podatki kot vizitke .vcf ter branje datoteke z vizitkami. Ko je izklopljeno, prenosi in uvoz niso na voljo, njihovi naslovi pa se odzivajo, kot da tam ni ničesar."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "DOCX"
msgstr "DOCX"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Extend file formats"
msgstr "Dodatni formati datotek"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "iCalendar"
msgstr "iCalendar"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "ODT"
msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Besedilo OpenDocument: življenjepis ali pismo, preneseno kot datoteka .odt, in besedilo naložene datoteke .odt, shranjeno, da ga iskanje lahko najde. Ko je izklopljeno, prenos ni na voljo, besedilo naložene datoteke pa se ne prebere."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Lokacije podjetij kot datoteka GeoJSON za izvoz in uvožene točke, ki ročno postavijo naslov podjetja, ko jih označite. Potrebuje Zemljevide. Ko je izklopljeno, ni na voljo nič od tega, njihovi naslovi pa se odzivajo, kot da tam ni ničesar."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "Formati datotek, ki jih Postulo poleg lastnega zna brati in pisati: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard in Europass. To je stikalo za vse hkrati; vsakega je še vedno mogoče izklopiti posebej, medtem ko je to vklopljeno, razen PDF. Ko je izklopljeno, v teh formatih ni na voljo nič in nič se ne izbriše: datoteke, ki jih imate, in podatki, iz katerih so nastale, ostanejo."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "Format, v katerem nastaneta življenjepis in pismo: s strukturnimi oznakami, da ga bralnik zaslona lahko prebere. Vedno vklopljeno; Postulo nima ničesar drugega, kar bi še bil življenjepis."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Dokumenti Word: življenjepis ali pismo, preneseno kot datoteka .docx, in besedilo naložene datoteke .docx, shranjeno, da ga iskanje lahko najde. Ko je izklopljeno, prenos ni na voljo, besedilo naložene datoteke pa se ne prebere."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Vaš koledar kot datoteke in viri .ics ter branje datoteke koledarja. Ko je izklopljeno, prenosi, uvoz in viri niso na voljo, njihovi naslovi pa se odzivajo, kot da tam ni ničesar; ko je spet vklopljeno, se na istem naslovu znova odzivajo."
